'''Chie Satō''' (Japanese: '''佐藤智恵''' ''Satō Chie'') is a Japanese voice actress for {{aniseries|PTS}}.

==Biography==
Satō was born on July 1, 1964 in {{wp|Saitama (city)|Saitama}}, {{wp|Japan}}, and became a voice actress as an adult. She began working on {{aniseries|PTS}} during {{aniseries|RS}}, with her most famous role being that of [[Jessie's Seviper]]. In [[4Kids Entertainment|4Kids]] dub of the series, some of the noises she made as Seviper were retained. Satō is currently affiliated with {{wp|Aoni Production}}.

